  "description": "YAMI global navigation band. At and above 1024px: brand lockup, storefront hall switcher, locale, deliver-to, search, account / cart, and a category rail whose entries are campaign artwork rather than icon components. Below 1024px it swaps to mobile chrome. The default variant uses a 56px brand bar over a 36px search field; the PDP variant uses a single 56px H5 row with lockup, deliver-to, search, and cart.",
